{
    "name": "pr-task-center-notification-workflow",
    "description": "Post-hook workflow for the Purchase Requisition Agent. Triggered after a PR is successfully created; extracts PR details from the incoming A2A message and creates a SAP Task Center approval task assigned to the approving manager. On Task Center failure, continues silently via continueRegularOutput. A Switch node routes the task outcome; both branches return a valid A2A response with empty parts.",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "content": "## PR Task Center Post-Hook\nThis workflow is triggered by the agent runtime **after** a purchase requisition is successfully created.\n\n- Extracts PR details (PR number, requester, line items, total, manager email) from the A2A message\n- Creates a SAP Task Center task for the approving manager\n- `onError: continueRegularOutput` — Task Center failures are silent\n- Switch routes the task outcome (approved/rejected/fallback)\n- All branches return a valid A2A response with empty parts",
                "height": 200,
                "width": 460,
                "color": 5
            },
            "id": "bad98c84-b577-4893-9d53-ab621f204f57",
            "name": "Workflow Overview",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                -620,
                -280
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "httpMethod": "POST",
                "path": "pr-task-center-hook-ed512/pr-task-center-notification-workflow/pr-creation-post-hook",
                "responseMode": "responseNode",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "76b82d7d-72f6-42cb-9b1f-049279e9608d",
            "name": "PR Creation Post-Hook",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
            "typeVersion": 2.1,
            "position": [
                -620,
                0
            ],
            "webhookId": "11fd88f6-e347-4862-beb5-e2de2e63d3e8"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Extract PR details and A2A context from the incoming post-hook message\nconst body = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst messageId = body.messageId || ('post-hook-' + Date.now());\nconst parts = body.parts || [];\n\n// Collect text from all A2A parts\nlet prText = '';\nfor (const part of parts) {\n  if (part.kind === 'text' && part.text) {\n    prText += part.text + ' ';\n  } else if (part.kind === 'data' && part.data) {\n    prText += JSON.stringify(part.data) + ' ';\n  }\n}\nprText = prText.trim();\n\n// Extract individual PR fields using regex; fall back to 'not provided'\nconst extractField = (patterns, text) => {\n  for (const pattern of patterns) {\n    const match = text.match(pattern);\n    if (match && match[1]) return match[1].trim();\n  }\n  return 'not provided';\n};\n\nconst prNumber = extractField([\n  /PR[\\s#:]+([A-Z0-9-]+)/i,\n  /purchase requisition[:\\s]+([A-Z0-9-]+)/i,\n  /requisition[\\s#:]+([A-Z0-9-]+)/i\n], prText);\n\nconst requester = extractField([\n  /requester[:\\s]+([^,\\n]+)/i,\n  /requested by[:\\s]+([^,\\n]+)/i,\n  /created by[:\\s]+([^,\\n]+)/i\n], prText);\n\nconst totalValue = extractField([\n  /total[:\\s]+([\\d.,]+\\s*[A-Z]{0,3})/i,\n  /amount[:\\s]+([\\d.,]+\\s*[A-Z]{0,3})/i,\n  /value[:\\s]+([\\d.,]+\\s*[A-Z]{0,3})/i\n], prText);\n\nconst lineItems = extractField([\n  /line items?[:\\s]+([^\\n]+)/i,\n  /items?[:\\s]+([^\\n]+)/i,\n  /materials?[:\\s]+([^\\n]+)/i\n], prText);\n\nconst approvingManagerEmail = extractField([\n  /approving manager[:\\s]+([\\w.+-]+@[\\w.-]+\\.[a-z]{2,})/i,\n  /manager email[:\\s]+([\\w.+-]+@[\\w.-]+\\.[a-z]{2,})/i,\n  /approve[:\\s]+([\\w.+-]+@[\\w.-]+\\.[a-z]{2,})/i\n], prText);\n\nreturn {\n  messageId,\n  prNumber,\n  requester,\n  totalValue,\n  lineItems,\n  approvingManagerEmail,\n  rawText: prText\n};"
            },
            "id": "7c8f3044-f4fa-45e8-87a7-219c4ec786d9",
            "name": "Extract PR Details",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                -380,
                0
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "subject": "=Purchase Requisition Approval Required: {{ $json.prNumber !== 'not provided' ? $json.prNumber : 'New PR' }}",
                "description": "=A new purchase requisition has been created and requires your approval.\n\nPR Number: {{ $json.prNumber }}\nRequester: {{ $json.requester }}\nLine Items: {{ $json.lineItems }}\nTotal Value: {{ $json.totalValue }}\n\nPlease review and approve or reject this purchase requisition in SAP Task Center.",
                "priority": "MEDIUM",
                "recipients": {
                    "recipientValues": [
                        {
                            "userId": "={{ $json.approvingManagerEmail }}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "taskDefinition": {
                    "definitionName": "Create PR Approval Task"
                },
                "customAttributeDefinitions": {
                    "attributes": [
                        {
                            "value": "={{ $json.prNumber }}",
                            "code": "prNumber",
                            "name": "PR Number",
                            "type": "STRING"
                        },
                        {
                            "value": "={{ $json.requester }}",
                            "code": "requester",
                            "name": "Requester",
                            "type": "STRING"
                        },
                        {
                            "value": "={{ $json.totalValue }}",
                            "code": "totalValue",
                            "name": "Total Value",
                            "type": "STRING"
                        },
                        {
                            "value": "={{ $json.lineItems }}",
                            "code": "lineItemsSummary",
                            "name": "Line Items Summary",
                            "type": "STRING"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            },
            "id": "802a16ec-b20f-4929-b83d-1a95e3fd9760",
            "name": "Create PR Approval Task",
            "type": "CUSTOM.sapTaskCenter",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                -140,
                0
            ],
            "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "rules": {
                    "values": [
                        {
